=== M9: Guerrero con un cero; cuerpo de forecast:::guer.cv (c3-m9-05, c3-m9-43) ===
min: 0  ceros en la ventana: 1  ceros serie completa: 3 
--- BoxCox.lambda guerrero sobre la serie cruda (con un cero):
AVISO: Guerrero's method for selecting a Box-Cox parameter (lambda) is given for strictly positive data. 
lambda cruda: 0.3333 
lambda desplazada (+1): 0.3062 
--- cuerpo de forecast:::guer.cv:
function (lam, x, nonseasonal.length = 2) 
{
    period <- round(max(nonseasonal.length, frequency(x)))
    nobsf <- length(x)
    nyr <- floor(nobsf/period)
    nobst <- floor(nyr * period)
    x.mat <- matrix(x[(nobsf - nobst + 1):nobsf], period, nyr)
    x.mean <- colMeans(x.mat, na.rm = TRUE)
    x.sd <- apply(x.mat, 2, sd, na.rm = TRUE)
    x.rat <- x.sd/x.mean^(1 - lam)
    sd(x.rat, na.rm = TRUE)/mean(x.rat, na.rm = TRUE)
}
